          "title": "Chop thyme and garlic",
          "description": "Remove the thyme leaves from the stems and finely chop them. Finely grate the garlic or press it through a garlic press."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "heat-honey-mix-butter-snack-butter-with-mustard",
        "en": {
          "title": "Heat honey and mix with butter and mustards",
          "description": "Warm the honey in the microwave for 10–15 seconds until it is warm but not hot. Add it to the softened butter along with both types of mustard. Stir until well combined and smooth."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "add-seasonings-mix-snack-butter-with-mustard",
